{{!
    @template theme_nit/core/login_panel

    NIT override of core/login_panel.

    NIT uses a single-column login (no split-screen marketing panel), so this
    override intentionally renders nothing for the left panel. Keeping it here —
    rather than editing theme/boost's core template in place — means Moodle
    upgrades never conflict with, or silently revert, this customisation.
}}
